                </td>
                <td>
                  <p><span style="color:#000000"><b>Page ref within IA</b></span></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <p><span style="color:#000000"><b>Statutory equality duties</b></span><authorialNote marker="1"><p><b> </b><b>Public bodies including Whitehall departments are required to consider the impact of their policies and measures on race, disability and gender. It is intended to extend this consideration requirement under the Equality Act 2010 to cover age, sexual orientation, religion or belief and gender reassignment from April 2011 (to Great Britain only). The Toolkit provides advice on statutory equality duties for public authorities with a remit in Northern Ireland.</b></p></authorialNote></p>
                  <p />
                </td>
                <td>
                  <p><span style="color:#000000">No</span></p>
                </td>
