                  <p><span style="color:#000000">13,000</span></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </content>
        </paragraph>
        <paragraph>
          <content>
            <p><span style="color:#000000"><b>Table 5 - Costs to DSA from2010/11 over 10 years (Not Discounted) (£k) </b></span><br /><span style="color:#000000"><b>Best estimate scenario (Option 3) (constant prices) (rounded to the nearest £1k) (based on 25% increase over baseline)</b></span></p>
            <table uk:widths="4.49in 1.43in">
              <tr>
